# Optimized Modelfile for Qwen2.5 72B on AMD Ryzen AI Max+ 395 (128GB RAM)
# 
# This Modelfile creates a custom model variant optimized for the EVO-X2 hardware:
# - 16 Zen 5 cores (32 threads)
# - RDNA 3.5 iGPU (40 CUs, unified memory access)
# - 128GB unified RAM
#
# Usage:
#   ollama create qwen72b-rag -f Modelfile.qwen72b-optimized
#   Then update .env: LLM_MODEL=qwen72b-rag

FROM qwen2.5:72b-instruct-q4_K_M

# Threading: Match Zen 5 core count for optimal CPU utilization
PARAMETER num_thread 16

# Context Window: 32K tokens (balance between capability and speed)
# The 72B model supports up to 128K, but 32K is faster for RAG
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768

# Batch Processing: Larger batches leverage unified memory bandwidth
PARAMETER num_batch 512

# GPU Layers: Offload ALL layers to iGPU (unified memory advantage)
# With 128GB RAM, the entire 72B Q4 model (~42GB) fits easily
PARAMETER num_gpu 999

# Temperature: Low for factual RAG responses
PARAMETER temperature 0.1

# Top-P: Slightly constrained for focused outputs
PARAMETER top_p 0.9

# Top-K: Standard value
PARAMETER top_k 40

# Repeat Penalty: Prevent repetitive outputs
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1

# Mirostat: Disabled for consistent RAG outputs
PARAMETER mirostat 0

# System Prompt: Optimized for RAG use case
SYSTEM """You are a knowledgeable AI assistant that answers questions based on provided context documents. 
You provide accurate, well-structured responses that directly address the user's questions.
When information is not available in the context, you clearly state this limitation.
You cite specific details from the context when relevant."""
